       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TRAWUSAG.
       AUTHOR.        K MOVSESIAN.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  MAY  01, 1989.

      *REMARKS.
      *
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **   T R A W U S A G - RAW MATERIAL MONTH TO DATE USAGE     **
      **                     REPORT                               **
      **                                                          **
      **   THIS REPORT SHOWS RAW MATERIAL INFORMATION SUCH AS
      **   CURRENT ONHAND, RECEIPTS MONTH TO DATE AND YESTERDAY,  **
      **   ONORDER, USAGE MONTH TO DATE AND TODAY, AVERAGE USAG, AND    ***
      **   ONHAND BASED ON DAYS LEFT.  THE NUMBER OF DAYS WORKED  **
      **   (PRODUCTION DAYS IS ENTER ON THE SELECTION SCREEN.      **
      **                                                          **
      **   AVERAGE USAGE IS COMPUTED BY TAKING MONTH TO DATE USAGE**
      **   AND DIVIDING IT BY NUMBER OF DAYS WORKED.              **
      **   DAYS LEFT IS COMPUTED BY TAKING THE CURRENT ONHAND AND **
      **   DIVIDING IT BY AVERAGE USAGE.                          **
      **   CLASS TOTALS FOR TOTAL POUNDS AND GALLONS IS ALSO SHOWN**
      **                                                          **
      **                                                          **
      **     XRSCREEN REPORT NO. - 56                             **
      **     REPORT HEADER       - HDR56.PUB                      **
      **     FORM NAME IN FRSCREEN - FRAWUSAG                     **
      **     R19 ON THE MATERIALS CONTROL MENU (UDCMC.PUB)        **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
      *C  24NOV1992         DAVE PLUM      REQUEST #6317
      *C  ADDED DISPLAY STATEMENTS IN AN ATTEMPT TO DETERMINE WHY
      *C  THIS PROGRAM IS BLOWING UP WITH A FILE STATUS OF 49 ON
      *C  THE CODE-FILE.  (FILE STATUS=49, A DELETE OR REWRITE IS
      *C  BEING ATTEMPTED ON A FILE WHICH IS NOT OPEN I-O.
      *C
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO RESET THE "REWRITE-SW" TO SPACES PRIOR TO
      *C  REOPENING THE CODE-FILE "INPUT".  THE PGM WAS ATTEMPTING
      *C  TO DO A REWRITE ON CODE-FILE WITH THE FILE OPEN FOR INPUT
      *C  ONLY, AND YOU CAN ONLY REWRITE WITH A FILE OPEN I-O.
      *C
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  SEPT 17, 1996   CA YODER
      *C   MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.  ALSO CHANGED
      *C   JULIAN DATE CONVERSION TO USE "JULGREG" ROUTINE.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      C01 IS NEW-PAGE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT PRINT-FILE      ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT SORT-FILE       ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT SORT-FILE2      ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT CODE-FILE       ASSIGN TO DISK-CODEFILE.

           SELECT USED-TODAY-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-USEDFILE.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DRCVITEM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1202
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDAILYTC-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DTRANS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT USAGEFIL-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

